# Proxy image vulnerability exceptions.
#
# Keep this file empty unless a HIGH/CRITICAL finding has no available patched
# package or base image. Each exception must be one exact CVE ID and include an
# owner, rationale, upstream tracking URL, and expiry date in the immediately
# preceding comments, using this exact shape:
# owner: @github-handle
# expires: YYYY-MM-DD
# tracking: https://upstream.example/issue
# rationale: No patched release exists; compensating control ...
# CVE-YYYY-NNNN
#
# Wildcards, GHSA aliases, and severity-wide suppressions are prohibited.
